  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hungerfree in Ramadan - Humanitarian Relief</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For this year&apos;s humanitarian relief for Ramadan, we want to specifically address children living with disabilities. Decades of violence have left large parts of the population with disabilities due to injuries. However, they lack urgently needed support and are far too often forgotten when it comes to humanitarian aid, medical care or educational opportunities. Together we can reach 600 families with food packages so that they can go through the holy month of Ramadan free of hunger!</narrative>
  </description>
